  (text "Two AMS1117-5.0 linear regulators (Basic; v3 used 2x 7805). U_ESP feeds the DevKit through a\n2x22R pre-drop (shares the heat: ~0.25 W in the resistors, ~0.7 W in the LDO at 150 mA) and\nSS34 (USB back-feed). U_LOG feeds +5V: IBT-2 logic, 74HC14, IMU, 3.3 V LDO. Give both SOT-223\ntabs copper."
    (at 228.6 30.64 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "64bca53a-9c49-5f56-8023-77b1a27eba38"))
